comments[8]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-19T04:09:36.934Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check (all statuses): strict full-corpus review of all 2,522 items plus targeted title/description searches for Greptile 3.4.1, Greptile dependency updates, and compatible dependency refreshes found prior closed 3.3/3.4 tranches pm-7564ov and pm-87hmdw but no item owning the new 3.4.1 patch. The separately incompatible npm-package-arg 14 and TypeScript 7 majors remain canonically owned by pm-ksr40d and pm-do5b."
  "2026-08-19T04:10:07.940Z","harness:codex","Implementation start 2026-08-19: adopt Greptile 3.4.1 and prove the compatible review-tooling patch under the complete combined quality and consumer matrix."
  "2026-08-19T05:28:40.174Z","harness:codex","Pre-PR evidence 2026-08-19: package.json and pnpm-lock.yaml resolve the compatible @greptile/cli 3.4.1 patch. pnpm audit reports 0 info/low/moderate/high/critical vulnerabilities across 357 dependencies; the tracked-file secret scanner reports no credential-like material. Full 7,597-test exact 100/100/100/100 coverage, static assurance, generated contracts, and packed npm/npx/Bun/bunx acceptance pass. Remaining acceptance is successful review-loop execution on the committed PR head, so this chore stays active through hosted review."
  "2026-08-19T05:47:19.723Z","harness:codex","Updated pre-PR evidence 2026-08-19: Greptile remains resolved at 3.4.1; the final combined tree passes 530 files and 7,598 tests at exact 100/100/100/100, repository static assurance, ESLint, zero-clone detection across 1,052 files, tracked-file secret scanning, and pnpm audit with no known vulnerabilities. Packed npm, npx, Bun, and bunx acceptance passes. Hosted exact-head review remains the final acceptance step."
  "2026-08-19T06:18:21.476Z","harness:codex","Exact-head local amendment evidence 2026-08-19: after the global semantic spelling invariant and its cross-command negative control, the normal-environment suite passes all 530 files and 7,598 tests at exact 100/100/100/100. The earlier EDQUOT run and alternate-TMPDIR provenance branch were environmental limitations; clearing only generated task caches restored the normal gate without source workarounds."
  "2026-08-19T06:28:58.221Z","harness:codex","Final local pre-PR inventory 2026-08-19: @greptile/cli resolves to 3.4.1; pnpm audit, tracked-secret scanning, ESLint, duplicate detection, exact coverage, and full static assurance pass. GitHub reports zero open PRs and zero open Dependabot, code-scanning, or secret-scanning alerts. The item remains actively claimed for its final hosted review-loop acceptance."
  "2026-08-19T06:30:33.163Z","harness:codex","Delivery PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1062 at implementation commit a6df8f64a. Hosted checks and required bot review are running against the combined SDK/CLI recovery-contract, semantic lexicon, generated-surface, dependency, documentation, and PM-evidence tranche."
  "2026-08-19T07:42:41.300Z","harness:codex","Review-round local evidence 2026-08-19: the Greptile 3.4.1 dependency remains resolved while review-driven SDK/CLI corrections pass 531 files and 7,600 tests at exact 100/100/100/100, zero-clone lint, full static assurance, isolated transport benchmarking, tracked-secret scanning, and pnpm audit with 0 info/low/moderate/high/critical vulnerabilities. Packed npx, bunx, and direct Bun installation report version 2026.8.19. Hosted exact-head review and check completion remain the final acceptance step, so this item remains actively claimed."
